{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"ferocious-meticulous-koala","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Complete A2 by removing the legacy field, so `bindings.json` carries no rotation bookkeeping at\nall. This is the irreversible half of A2. session_log **1cb6-d553-6565-49b4** (measured facts; do not re-derive).\n\n## Gate (must be satisfied before merging)\n- A2-1 merged to `main`, **>=24 h elapsed** (covers the host's hourly pipx tracker), **and**\n- a completed `reconcile-bridge.yml` run whose `github.sha` is a **descendant of A2-1's merge\n  commit** (`git merge-base --is-ancestor`).\n\nThe SHA check is the observable: `reconcile-bridge.yml:142` does `pip install .` from the checked-out\ntree, so the reconciler's code **is** the run's head SHA. (An earlier draft proposed checking a\n\"pass-record version stamp\" — that is unimplementable: `_write_pass_record`, `pass_io.py:47-62`,\nrecords only `pass_id`, `mutation_count` and `status`.)\n\nWriter set verified complete: the GHA reconciler and local probe runs. The canary runs only\n`bridge-fsck` + ticket CLI ops; the AWS review bot never writes `bindings.json`.\n\n## Approach\nStop writing `last_get_pass` in `set_last_get`; drop the `max(new, legacy)` fallback to read the new\nfile only (`max(new, \"\")` already degenerates to `new`, so this is a simplification); strip the field\nfrom entries on load-migration.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `last_get_pass` is absent from every entry in `bindings.json` after one pass, and rotation order\n      is preserved from `get_rotation.json` alone. Tier: **integration** in a real temporary git repo.\n- [ ] Anti-starvation still holds: every bound-but-absent key is serviced within `ceil(N/K)` passes\n      with only the new file present. Tier: **unit** on the rotation selector.\n- [ ] The gate evidence is recorded on this ticket as a comment: A2-1 merge SHA, the\n      `reconcile-bridge.yml` run id, and the `merge-base --is-ancestor` result. **[operator-attested]**\n- [ ] Marginal packed cost per changed version is at or below the A2-1 measurement. Tier:\n      **repo-level measurement**.\n\n## Files\n`binding_store.py`, the rotation module, tests\n\nScope: S. Depends on A3 (sequencing A1 -> A2-1 -> A3 -> A2-2).","id":"3592-0d1e-2bd6-4e22","parent_id":"0303-692c-55dc-4a18","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"A2-2: delete the legacy in-line last_get_pass field once every writer is upgraded"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785372494855599001,"uuid":"864e640f-dc02-4d81-a8e9-cde882e2203d"}